Please start by running the command to check your phone's network status. This will show airplane mode status, signal strength, network type, whether mobile data is enabled, and whether data roaming is enabled.

Once you have the results, please share them with me.
{
  "action": "check_network_status"
}

Please run the command on your phone to set the network mode preference to "4g_5g_preferred." Once done, share the result with me so I can assist you further.
{
  "action": "set_network_mode_preference",
  "parameters": {
    "mode": "4g_5g_preferred"
  }
}
Have you been able to set your phone's network mode preference to "4g_5g_preferred"? Please let me know the result or if you need help with this step.

Great! Now that you have excellent 5G signal strength and mobile data enabled with roaming, please run a speed test on your phone to check the current internet speed quality. Share the results with me so I can confirm if your internet speed is excellent or if further steps are needed.
Please run the following command on your phone to perform a speed test and share the results with me:

{
  "action": "run_speed_test"
}

Since your speed test result is "Fair" and not "Excellent," let's check if you have any data-limiting features enabled on your phone that might be restricting your data speed, such as Data Saver mode. Please run the command to check your phone's data restriction status and share the results with me.
{
  "action": "check_data_restriction_status"
}

Since your speed is now "Good" but not "Excellent," let's check if you have an active VPN connection that might be affecting your speed. Please run the command to check your phone's VPN status and share the results with me.
{
  "action": "check_vpn_status"
}
